      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"the Director General, or such authorized officer\" the words \"such officer\". Substitution of section 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 46 the following section: Obstruc- 46. Any person who obstructs the Commission or assaults, ting per- hinders, impedes or obstructs the Chairman of the formance of duties. Commission, any authorized officer or any officer authorized under section 41, in the performance of its or his duties under this Act shall be guilty of an offence.\". Substitution of section 47"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 47 the following section: Prosecu- 47. No prosecution shall be instituted for an offence tion. under this Act or any rules made hereunder except by or with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor.\". Saving and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon the commencement of this Act, references to the Government, Minister, Director General of Post or an authorized officer, in any written law including any subsidiary legislation, or in any instrument, licence, certificate, document, registration, approval, directive, order, guildeline, notification, agreement or other document made, issued or given before the commencement of this Act shall be construed as provided for in subsections (2), (3), (4), (5) and (6)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "References to the Government or the Director General of Post in relation to the functions of such Government or Director General which upon the commencement of this Act become the functions of the Commission shall be construed as references to the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "References to the Director General of Post in relation to the functions of such Director General which upon the commencement of this Act become the function of the Minister shall be construed as references to the Minister."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "References to the Director General of Post in relation to the functions of such Director General which upon the commencement of this Act become the functions of the Chairman of the Commission shall be construed as references to such Chairman."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "References to an authorized officer shall be construed as references to an authorized officer as defined in the principal Act as amended by this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/2/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All licences, certificates, documents, registrations, approvals, directives, orders, guidelines, notifications, agreements, and such other documents that have been made, issued or given by the Director General of Post, before the commencement of this All shall, upon the commencement of this Act, be construed as having been made, issued or given by the Commission or Chairman of the Commission, as the case may be."
      }
    },
